window.products.push({"id":1150396,"name":"Whiskey River - The Fun Uncle Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+cvKsNPqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A Candle for the Fun Uncle Beer me! White 80, hut, hut, hike! I still don't know what that means, but it's something my uncle would've said as he wrestled me and my brothers to the living room with a full beer in his paw while he simultaneously kept his eyes on the tv the whole time, stopping only to shout obscenities at the refs for \"cheating\" and being \"morons.\" Sure, someone always got injured in the end, but to be honest, rough-housing with the fun uncle was some of the best times we ever had. Black Ice Scented Net Weight: Approximately 17 oz. Burn time: 60 hours Note: Because all of our candles are handmade, no two are identical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+cvKsNPqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whiskey River Soap Co.","source_asin":"B09HN5LH8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HN5LH8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HN5LH8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1150397,"name":"TheBridesBouquet Artificial Red & Ivory Silk Rose Stems 6 Roses with Customize Ribbon | Fake Flowers Bouquets for Wedding, Hall Decoration | Gift for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GS6A0ggiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿ 𝐀𝐁𝐎𝐔𝐓 𝐁𝐎𝐔𝐐𝐔𝐄𝐓: Six blooming silk rose stems in the colors of love: Red and Ivory. The bouquet is 6 inches wide & 10 inches long. Pack it in a suitcase and take it anywhere you want to go. It will always look fabulous! No water needed. Silk flowers are durable and they won't wilt in the heat or freeze in the cold. This is the best choice for all kinds of weather conditions. Our artificial roses look like fresh flowers, but the best part is that they last ✿ 𝐂𝐔𝐒𝐓𝐎𝐌𝐈𝐙𝐄 𝐑𝐈𝐁𝐁𝐎𝐍: Our bouquets come with Customized Ribbons which means the stems are wrapped with white satin ribbon, or you can select another color from our 10 satin ribbon options. Choose your favorite color ribbon. Ideal for a bridesmaid, petite bride, junior bridesmaid, flower girl or wedding toss bouquet. ✿ 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 𝐌𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐑𝐈𝐀𝐋: We always take quality into mind when hand crafting our products. Each rose is made of high quality fabric, hand dyed to look as real as their fresh counterparts. A natural looking rose bouquet can be observed at any distance. Each flower stem has wire inside the stem for greater control over how it can be displayed. ✿ 𝐌𝐔𝐋𝐓𝐈𝐏𝐋𝐄 𝐔𝐒𝐀𝐆𝐄: Roses symbolize love and heartfelt emotion, Our red & ivory silk garden stem roses make perfect bridal bouquets for weddings. After the wedding, you can use them in your home as a newly married couple. You will love seeing the roses and remembering your special wedding day! Pop them into a vase for a splash of red and ivory color anywhere in your home: kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, entryway! ✿ 𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐒𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐒𝐅𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐆𝐔𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐄𝐄𝐃: : Our eye-catching bouquets are amazing and you will receive the exact flower bouquet as shown in the photos. Buy with confidence and enjoy this sensational wedding bouquet. You will not regret your purchase once you see these lovely flowers in person. We have tons of matching bouquets and wedding accessories in red and ivory so please feel free to visit our store and see all of the coordinating options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GS6A0ggiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TheBridesBouquet.com","source_asin":"B0083KD1RS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0083KD1RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0083KD1RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
