window.products.push({"id":1150409,"name":"Independence Day Flag Fondant Mold, American Patriot Epoxy Mold, Flag Star Chocolate Cake Decorating Mold for Independence Day Election, Patriotic Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718RqAXsUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About How to Use Silicone Molds 1. How to Demould? Pour the prepared mousse into molds and place in -18°C~-30°C freezer for 6-8 hours. Note that it is not refrigerated, and then take it out and turn it over to demould. 2. How to Clean Silicone Molds? Hand wash with detergent or dishwasher after use. 3. Can it be Put in the Oven? The mold can withstand temperatures from -40°C to 446°C, Baked products, frozen mousse are suitable.  Precautions 1. It is strictly forbidden to approach sharp objects.  2. The use of olive oil is strictly prohibited.  3. It is strictly forbidden to use the microwave Crisp key.  4. It is strictly forbidden to use steel wool or other metal cleaning tools to clean.  5. It is strictly forbidden to directly touch the open flame or close to the heat source (such as oven heating pipe). It is recommended that you place the mold on the upper part of the middle layer of the oven when baking, and keep a distance of at least 5cm from the heating pipe.  About US IKOJING flagship store is a brand store integrating R&D, production and sales. We have been focusing on silicone molds and other household kitchen supplies for many years, and are committed to providing customers with safe, practical and beautiful cake baking molds. Products are presented to customers. Quality Service If you have any questions about our products, you can contact us by email at any time and tell us your opinions and suggestions, we will provide better service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718RqAXsUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKOJING","source_asin":"B09ZBGPRGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZBGPRGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZBGPRGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
