window.products.push({"id":1150573,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners, 3-IN-1 Evaporative Air Cooler with 3 Modes 3 Speeds, 2L Water Tank, Bladeless Portable AC with 8H Timer, 40°Oscillation & R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OA3VeigbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【3 Modes & 3 Speeds】3-IN-1 portable air conditioner equipped with advanced cooling system that can cool down the temperature and increase the humidity in the air. The upgraded filter and water curtain make the air fresher while cooling. 3 modes(normal, sleep, natural)and 3 speeds as well as 40°automatic swing can meet all the needs for coolness. ❄️【Large Water Tank & 2 Ice Packs】The air conditioner portable is designed with a 2L water tank that can work continuously for up to 24 hours without frequent water addition. Adding ice cubes and 2 ice packs you can easily enjoy extra coolness in minutes. A fully detachable water tank design of the portable air cooler is easier to clean. ❄️【Remote Control & 8H Timer】For using the portable ac air conditioner more conveniently, besides doing the settings with an LED touch panel on the top of the air cooler, there is also a 30Ft remote control far distance making it easy to enjoy cooling wind without moving. What's more, you can enjoy all-night sleep with an 8-Hour timer setting and 40 dB quiet running. ❄️【More Efficient & Cost-saving】The air cooler only consumed around 80 watts of power when it's running which will greatly reduce your cost of getting cool in summer. Also, no window hose installing needed, it's a more cost-saving and effective way in hot summer. ❄️【The Safest Bladeless Deign】In any case, the motor and fan blades will not be touched, giving children and pets the highest sense of security, you can safely leave them alone. The portable ac unit is the best choice for families with children and pets. The compact size(10.3x7.5x24.8 inches) of this personal air conditioner makes it easy to store when not in use. ❄️【No Risk Purchase】We truly provide a 1-year warranty and a 60-days no-question refund for our customers. Any questions about this air conditioner for room, please feel free to contact us, we are here to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OA3VeigbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uvistare","source_asin":"B09TVL26VN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TVL26VN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TVL26VN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
