window.products.push({"id":1150628,"name":"American Kitchen Premium Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Stock Pot - with Cover, 8 Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":260.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I9BWP311L._AC_.jpg","description":"Even Cooking Every Time: Two layers of stainless steel wrap around a heat-conducting aluminum core. The aluminum helps your pan heat evenly with no hot spots for uniform cooking while double-layered stainless steel durability earns this pan immediate heirloom status. Detailed Design: Our performance handles are built to help you focus on what matters: making memories. They stay cool when you’re cooking on the stove and are made to maximize comfort and efficiency as you move throughout the kitchen. Every Cooktop Compatible + Oven Safe: Because our pans have a magnetic stainless steel exterior, you can use them on all cooking surfaces—electric, gas, induction, and ceramic glass. Rest assured that our cookware is made to fit your kitchen, not the other way around. Our stainless steel pans are oven safe up to 500°F, which means that you can give any dish that crispy, golden finishing touch. Easy to Care For: Not only is our stainless steel skillet durable, but it’s also easy to care for, which means most messes can be cleaned with a little soap and water magic so you can spend less time on cleanup and more time enjoying those around your table. Made in America: American Kitchen is part of over a century’s worth of family-owned cookware manufacturing. This means that your pieces are handcrafted and inspected right here in West Bend, WI. We’ve made it our mission to take care of your family just as well as we’ve taken care of ours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I9BWP311L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Kitchen","source_asin":"B07CDPMWVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CDPMWVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CDPMWVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
