window.products.push({"id":1150636,"name":"NOVICA Black and White Animal Themed Modern and Freestyle Painting from Mexico 'Whale Shark'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Scv7QhU6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: Swimmers in fins circle an impressive whale shark in the clear waters of the Mexican Caribbean. Marina Pallares depicts the dramatic scene in this small-scale linoleum block print. \"Such an impressive shark! In addition to being absolutely beautiful, you can swim with them off the island of Holbox,\" the artist says. \"This series of prints has been greatly influenced by my love for the Riviera Maya my second home.\" Larger than many dinosaurs, the grey fish with its distinctive spots can measure as much as 40 feet long and weigh more than 15 tons. Fortunately for swimmers, it is essentially vegan. Tiled \"Tiburon ballena\" in Spanish.Arrives unframedEach work features slight variations that make it uniqueLimited editionSigned by the artistAbout our Artist: Mexico's Marina Pallares believes painting has always been her destiny. 'Throughout my life, certain unexplainable things keep happening that lure me to the path of the fine arts. I adapt techniques according to the theme that I'm working on. Most of my themes revolve around people and ordinary activities such as drinking coffee, riding a bike or dancing. Although sometimes I can be more complicated and express my dreams, my feelings, and other personal issues.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Scv7QhU6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B09KV5822V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KV5822V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KV5822V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
