window.products.push({"id":1150767,"name":"IVWVI Shower Caddy Shelf,Adhesive Shower Rack with Tooth Brushing Holder/Soap Holder Dish/Razor Holder/Shampoo Holder/Towel Shelf/15 Hooks,Shower Acce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c3gbYDFLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Black Shower Caddy - Large Capacity, Multifunctional】 Our Bathroom Shower Shelf Set includes 1*Large Size Shower Caddy , 1*Medium Size Shower Caddy , 1*Soap Holder, 1*Toothbrush Holder, 1*Towel Holder, 15*Hooks, 5*Large Adhesives（1* Spare）, 3*Small Adhesives（1* Spare）. The large capacity bathroom organizer shower rack can store most of your shower supplies. Multiple number of hooks to hang shower loofahs, razors or anything you want. It can effectively help you organize your shower or bathroom supplies. It is ideal for bathroom, toilet, kitchen, living room and bedroom storage. They keep everything in order. 👍【Durable Stainless Steel Shower Shelf】 This black shower shelf is made of high quality stainless steel metal with a painted surface for secondary protection that is waterproof, rustproof and scratch resistant, improving the scratch resistance and durability of the bathroom organizer. The hollow design of the shower wall shelf allows water to dry faster, preventing the growth of scale and bacteria. The smooth surface won't scratch you and damage items. The enclosure of this shower shelf is widened to prevent bottles from falling and provide stronger support. The reinforced design at the bottom with dense line edges also provides more support. ✅【Strong Weight-Bearing Capacity】: The upgraded adhesive shower caddy provides super stability and the shower organizer can withstand a minimum weight of 30 lbs. The adhesive density is thicker than normal, you don't have to worry about it falling off the wall after installation. This shower caddy comes with 8 shower caddy adhesives, 5 large sizes and 3 small sizes (each comes with 1 spare).If you need to tear off the adhesive, just use a hot hair dryer on the adhesive for 2-3 minutes and it will come off without leaving any marks on the wall. 👍【No Drilling, Easy to Install】 This black in-shower storage caddy shelf can be easily installed by one person. Simply apply adhesive, no drilling, no tools required, and no damage to walls.Applicable wall surfaces include:Tile,Marble,Tempered Glass,Smooth and Flat Wooden Walls,Smooth and Flat Metal Surface,etc.Not applicable wall contains:Painted Walls,Rough Surface,Sticker Wall,Limed Wall,Concrete Wall,etc. 💌【Best Experience and After-Sales Service】 Are you tired of messy bathrooms? Bathroom shower shelves are designed for those who need more space and to keep supplies neat and tidy, you will get an organized bathroom or shower, kitchen, living room, etc. The shower shelf organizer is an ideal gift for family and friends.Your satisfaction is our greatest support and encouragement,and we are very concerned about the feeling of your experience. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us,and we will provide a satisfactory solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c3gbYDFLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IVWVI","source_asin":"B0BK8YJ32B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK8YJ32B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK8YJ32B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
