window.products.push({"id":1150940,"name":"ZOOCRAFT Frog Decor Figurines Blown Glass Animals Poison Dart Hand Painted Art Miniature Garden Decoration Statues Collectibles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lRza7GWEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you Love Frog Figurines and Frog Themed Gifts?  It’s funny how people usually like frogs figurines, frog statues, frog themed gifts, frog collectibles but will jump 10 feet high if they actually see a frog!  Anyways, frog figurines are extremely cute and they will not jump on you and they will not feel wet, cold and slimy either! The frog totem symbolizes the cycles of life, in particular, the rebirth stage. Its own journey through life, from tadpole to the adult state, reminds us of the many cycles of transformation and rebirth in our lives. From the Manufacturer We love blown glass because of the pure imagination poured into every piece created. Our art glass pieces come from our own ideas and designs. Our artists use an open flame torch to melt down glass rods and then delicately shape the molten glass. Once the sculpt is finished, our professional artists carefully paint each glass figurine, detailing every nook and cranny.  The sculptures look like live animals, and we think they are different from others you might see. we enjoy the process of creating our own ideas and developing them into original works of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lRza7GWEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOOCRAFT","source_asin":"B07KRWDCQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1150940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRWDCQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRWDCQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
